<title>USA: Digital Biometrics CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Digital Biometrics CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Biometrics Inc said Tuesday its chief financial officer Donald Berg was resigning to take a similar position with BORN Information Services Group.</p>
<p>The company will conduct a search to find a replacement, Berg said.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
